{"name":"-68-S-2","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":true,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The latest report has been transmitted. Please enter the keycode to unlock the report."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"unknown","raw":"true","value":"3"},{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Keycode Question... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Why is Maggie Ponzi always sitting on desks?"},{"text":"A. Desks are expensive. She doesn't want them to be stolen.","style":{"r":""}},{"text":"B. She only dares to speak when sitting on a desk.","style":{"r":""}},{"text":"C. Sitting on a desk gives her an advantage in negotiations.","style":{"r":""}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"},{"type":"branch","value":"2","raw":"分支"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_PPT_Switch","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"687","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"branch","value":"2","raw":"分支"},{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"}],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"82, 101, 105, 110, 101, 116, 116, 101, 39, 115, 32, 116, 114, 117, 101, 32, 104, 101, 105,","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"103, 104, 116, 32, 105, 115, 32, 97, 99, 116, 117, 97, 108, 108, 121, 32, 116,","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"104, 101, 32, 115, 97, 109, 101, 32, 97, 115, 32, 109, 105, 110, 101, 46","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"2","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hello? Do you not understand what I just said? Of course you don't.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's all scrambled code.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You only get to read the report if you answer the question correctly~","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"},{"type":"branch","value":"2","raw":"分支"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_PPT_Switch","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"},{"type":"branch","value":"1","raw":"分支"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_PPT_Switch","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"687","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"branch","value":"1","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"231, 142, 177, 229, 156, 139, 229, 134, 178, 229, 143, 145, 230, 157, 142, 230, 156, 137, 229, 165, 189, 239, 188, 140, 229, 149, 134, 230, 151, 165, 230, 148, 185, 229, 156, 139, 229, 156, 168,","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"231, 165, 158, 229, 147, 129, 232, 181, 176, 232, 191, 153, 229, 144, 136, 229, 143, 163, 229, 176, 143, 228, 186, 134, 229, 143, 164, 229, 155, 189, 239, 188, 140, 230, 150, 151, 230, 156, 137, 231, 163, 141, 229, 155,","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"189, 230, 177, 179, 227, 128, 130, 229, 143, 130, 229, 176, 143, 230, 178, 187, 229, 174, 158, 229, 174, 129, 229, 133, 177, 230, 155, 155, 229, 137, 141, 231, 137, 136, 230, 156, 137, 239, 188, 140","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"1","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hello? Do you not understand what I just said? Of course you don't.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's all scrambled code.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You only get to read the report if you answer the question correctly~","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"},{"type":"branch","value":"1","raw":"分支"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_PPT_Switch","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"},{"type":"branch","value":"3","raw":"分支"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_PPT_Switch","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"687","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"branch","value":"3","raw":"分支"},{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_2022_Summer_AVG_2","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hailing AR-18. Hailing AR-18. Time for my scheduled check-in.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The investigation is still ongoing. There has been some progress, but I still haven't found anything that will aid in the Commander's rescue.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I met Natalie, who's apparently the maid who used to take care of me. She has also recovered my memories many times...","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But I don't remember any of it.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"3","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Also, I finally found out what Mother looked like and even learned a little about his work.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Yeah, it had something to do with the Fox Sisterhood. I saw the real Maggie and Catherine—not the two fakes on the train.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Still, having met the real deal, I must say the imposters actually did a brilliant job at capturing the air and demeanor of their namesakes.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Maggie's moral ambiguity and natural poise as a social engineer really were incomparable.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"branch","value":"3","raw":"分支"}],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I am now following the lead regarding the Fox Sisterhood. Hopefully 520 is right, and we are on the right track to finding Mother's legacy...","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'll get in touch if I learn anything new.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_PPT_Switch","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
